{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"In space, there is a planet family. These planets all travel around the Sun together.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.27,0.91],[1,1.23],[1.28,1.37],[1.42,1.44],[1.51,1.92],[2,2.65],[3.03,3.32],[3.39,3.87],[3.92,4.14],[4.23,4.63],[4.7,5.02],[5.06,5.13],[5.19,5.46],[5.53,6.41]]},{"text":"There are eight planets in our solar system. Each one has its own name and look.","words":[[0,0.33],[0.38,0.57],[0.65,0.94],[1.01,1.47],[1.52,1.59],[1.65,1.79],[1.87,2.25],[2.32,2.89],[3.27,3.54],[3.63,3.85],[3.9,4.06],[4.14,4.32],[4.4,4.69],[4.76,5.05],[5.11,5.26],[5.35,6.04]]},{"text":"Mercury is small and close to the Sun. It gets very hot during the day.","words":[[0,0.57],[0.64,0.74],[0.8,1.2],[1.26,1.41],[1.51,1.89],[1.94,2.01],[2.08,2.17],[2.24,2.77],[3.16,3.31],[3.37,3.61],[3.75,4.1],[4.2,4.49],[4.56,4.89],[4.95,5.02],[5.08,5.76]]},{"text":"Venus is covered in thick clouds. It is very hot, even hotter than Mercury.","words":[[0,0.44],[0.51,0.61],[0.71,1.14],[1.18,1.26],[1.36,1.65],[1.73,2.47],[2.72,2.87],[2.93,3.04],[3.18,3.54],[3.63,4.04],[4.12,4.43],[4.53,4.87],[4.91,5.07],[5.16,6.13]]},{"text":"Earth is our home. It has air, water, plants, and animals living together.","words":[[0,0.4],[0.48,0.61],[0.69,0.88],[0.97,1.44],[1.73,1.88],[1.93,2.1],[2.24,2.67],[2.73,3.18],[3.23,3.65],[3.67,3.81],[3.9,4.39],[4.47,4.76],[4.82,5.67]]},{"text":"Mars is called the red planet. Its surface looks dusty and red.","words":[[0,0.44],[0.51,0.61],[0.7,1.01],[1.03,1.1],[1.18,1.41],[1.5,2.09],[2.47,2.69],[2.74,3.23],[3.27,3.56],[3.7,4.25],[4.32,4.46],[4.56,5.29]]},{"text":"Jupiter is the biggest planet. It has colorful stripes and a giant storm.","words":[[0,0.55],[0.63,0.73],[0.78,0.85],[0.92,1.3],[1.37,1.95],[2.19,2.35],[2.39,2.54],[2.68,3.29],[3.35,3.87],[3.92,4.08],[4.14,4.17],[4.31,4.77],[4.84,5.8]]},{"text":"Saturn wears beautiful rings. The rings are made of ice and rock pieces.","words":[[0,0.51],[0.58,0.88],[0.97,1.53],[1.61,2.19],[2.48,2.65],[2.73,3.02],[3.06,3.2],[3.25,3.47],[3.5,3.59],[3.73,4.08],[4.13,4.28],[4.39,4.66],[4.74,5.71]]},{"text":"Uranus and Neptune are far away. They are cold and look blue from space.","words":[[0,0.58],[0.65,0.74],[0.81,1.33],[1.38,1.54],[1.61,1.89],[1.96,2.45],[2.69,2.9],[2.95,3.1],[3.18,3.61],[3.68,3.8],[3.89,4.13],[4.23,4.6],[4.66,4.88],[4.97,5.9]]},{"text":"All planets move around the Sun. They shine because they reflect sunlight, not because they make light.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.37,0.87],[0.95,1.24],[1.29,1.63],[1.68,1.75],[1.82,2.36],[2.74,2.96],[3.05,3.5],[3.55,3.92],[3.95,4.11],[4.21,4.72],[4.79,5.56],[6.01,6.25],[6.32,6.69],[6.73,6.9],[6.98,7.23],[7.31,8.13]]},{"text":"At bedtime, we remember: eight planets travel together, and Earth is one special home.","words":[[0,0.21],[0.3,0.92],[0.94,1.06],[1.15,1.8],[2.18,2.45],[2.52,3.04],[3.1,3.48],[3.56,4.21],[4.42,4.63],[4.77,5.07],[5.14,5.27],[5.41,5.69],[5.74,6.21],[6.29,7.06]]}]}